Class: NRM
Halflife: 1.405e+10 years
Shielding: Stl05 Stl30
Description: Th232 is a naturally occuring radioative material with some industrial applications.  Although it may be found in various rocks, and although it is part of the decay chain of ???, when found in high concentrations it is often part of thoriated lantern mantles or welding rods.
